** {{audio|de|De-an.ogg}}
** {{rhymes|de|an|s=1}}
* A lengthened form {{IPAchar|/aːn/}} is possible in non-prepositional uses, e.g. in the prefix {{m|de|an-}} or the adverb {{m|de|daran}}. This was formerly widespread, but is now chiefly restricted to Austria and Switzerland (where it is optional). Compare similarly the distinction between {{m|de|in}} and {{m|de|ein-}}.
<!-- Claim in DWB that this was only Upper German is wrong. See RhWb for Rhenish and Adelung for ECG. -->

===Preposition===
{{head|de|preposition}} {{+obj|de|dat}}

# {{lb|de|local}} [[on]]; [[upon]]; [[at]]; [[in]]; [[against]]
#: {{ux|inline=1|de|Das Bild hängt '''an''' der Wand.|The picture hangs '''on''' the wall.}}
# [[by]]; [[near]]; [[close]] to; [[next]] to
# {{lb|de|temporal|with days or times of day}} [[on]]; [[in]]; [[at]]
